ASPIRATIONAL: pure-Koru comptime computation (a capture-fold) feeding runtime output.

Blocked: capture/for are comptime TRANSFORMS (pipeline passes) that cannot nest inside
comptime evaluation (KORU010). Needs a comptime Koru evaluator — the aspirational-
interpreter direction, not a patch. Green when that lands. Reds here are the to-do list.
